@startuml state_machine_bc
title BC State Machine (per LLR-1553-BC-010)

[*] --> IDLE

IDLE --> MAJOR_FRAME : start (valid schedule table)

MAJOR_FRAME --> MINOR_FRAME : minor frame start

MINOR_FRAME --> WAIT_RESPONSE : message issued,\nresponse expected
MINOR_FRAME --> MAJOR_FRAME : last minor frame\nof major frame done

WAIT_RESPONSE --> MINOR_FRAME : message complete
WAIT_RESPONSE --> TIMEOUT : NO_RESPONSE or\ninvalid status

TIMEOUT --> FAILOVER : alternate bus available\nand retry not yet used
TIMEOUT --> MINOR_FRAME : retry already used\n[RT marked failed]

FAILOVER --> WAIT_RESPONSE : retry on\nalternate bus

WAIT_RESPONSE --> MINOR_FRAME : retry also failed\n[RT marked failed]

MAJOR_FRAME --> DEGRADED : primary bus switch\n(REDUN-002 threshold)
MINOR_FRAME --> DEGRADED : primary bus switch
WAIT_RESPONSE --> DEGRADED : primary bus switch
TIMEOUT --> DEGRADED : primary bus switch
FAILOVER --> DEGRADED : primary bus switch

DEGRADED --> MAJOR_FRAME : continue on\nremaining capability

IDLE --> IDLE : stop (self)
MAJOR_FRAME --> IDLE : stop
MINOR_FRAME --> IDLE : stop
WAIT_RESPONSE --> IDLE : stop
TIMEOUT --> IDLE : stop
FAILOVER --> IDLE : stop
DEGRADED --> IDLE : stop

note right of TIMEOUT
  Any event not listed as a
  transition from the current
  state is ignored and counted
  (LLR-1553-BC-010).
end note

@enduml